      "value": "@{62518888a488275298e75145|full_name}: Thanks for the information and the video. Can you check if your index controller shows this tracking loss on the controller's 3d model visible when the SteamVR dashboard/overlay is open, while also making sure your 7 other trackers used for 10pt are turned on too? I'm curious if this is a radio frequency issue that only appears when you have many trackers switched on simultaneously.",
