      "value": "So far this appears to be a radio frequency issue. We'll need additional info to either confirm or rule out that possibility before any more steps can be taken on this. If anyone who can reproduce this issue is able to carry out the further testing step listed in my previous reply that would help.\nI'll re-post it here for convenience: Could you please turn on all your trackers as if you were using 10pt tracking, but use the normal non-beta version of VRChat for an extended session and check if you can observe the same tracking loss while all your devices are switched on?",
