      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have noticed that my index controllers were losing tracking more often since the latest IK beta, but I wasn't sure if it was due to throwing in the chest tracker as well. \nConfirming that it has only happened after being in VRC for some time and not immediately after startup.\nDon't really have any other datapoints to add.",
